---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){return ['en','es','pt','ru','tr'].map(lang=>({params:{lang}}))}
---
<Layout title="Editorial Policy | Sourcing Ally" description="How Sourcing Ally writes, reviews, updates, and limits its China sourcing educational content." lang="en">
  <section class="policy-hero"><div class="container policy-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Editorial standards</p><h1>Useful information should be clear about what it knows—and what it does not.</h1><p>Last reviewed: 13 August 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad section-light"><div class="container policy-grid"><article class="policy-body"><section><h2>Purpose of the knowledge library</h2><p>Sourcing Ally publishes services, product, city, sourcing-school, Journal, and Sourcing Questions pages to help international buyers understand common China sourcing decisions. The aim is to give visitors clearer questions, better preparation, and a more useful starting point for a real conversation.</p></section><section><h2>How content is prepared</h2><p>Pages combine confirmed Sourcing Ally service information with general educational research and practical sourcing questions. A page should explain the topic in plain language, identify what can change the answer, point to related information, and avoid promising a specific commercial, legal, logistics, testing, or supplier outcome.</p></section><section><h2>What we do not publish as fact</h2><p>Sourcing Ally does not publish invented client counts, testimonials, certifications, years of experience, warehouse claims, supplier networks, savings, success rates, guarantees, or case studies. Claims about a specific project should be confirmed before they are published.</p></section><section><h2>Updates and time-sensitive content</h2><p>Importing, customs, testing, certification, product safety, currency, transport, and legal requirements can change. Educational pages should carry a review date when the topic may be time-sensitive. Readers should check current information with qualified providers for the actual product, destination, shipment, or transaction.</p></section><section><h2>Corrections and feedback</h2><p>If you find an error, need clarification, or believe a page should be updated, contact sourcingally@gmail.com. Sourcing Ally can review the information and amend the page when appropriate.</p></section></article><aside class="policy-aside"><div><p class="eyebrow">Reader promise</p><b>Clear structure. Practical context. Honest limits.</b></div><div><p class="eyebrow">For real projects</p><p>General education is not a substitute for a written project scope, current professional advice, or verification of the actual supplier and product.</p></div><a class="button" href="/en/questions/">Explore Sourcing Questions ↗</a></aside></div></section>
</Layout>
<style>.policy-hero{background:#f4f8ff;padding:88px 0 98px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.policy-hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(40,103,217,.09) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(40,103,217,.09) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:45px 45px;opacity:.4}.policy-wrap{max-width:970px;position:relative}.policy-wrap h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.8rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.075em;max-width:950px;margin:0 0 23px}.policy-wrap>p:last-child{color:var(--muted)}.policy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .42fr;gap:90px}.policy-body{max-width:790px}.policy-body section{margin-bottom:44px}.policy-body h2{font-size:1.85rem;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0 0 11px}.policy-body p{color:#405069;font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.85;margin:0}.policy-aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px}.policy-aside>div{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:20px;background:white}.policy-aside b{font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}.policy-aside p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0}.policy-aside .button{align-self:flex-start}@media(max-width:760px){.policy-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.policy-hero{padding:70px 0 78px}.policy-wrap h1{font-size:3rem}}</style>
